---

<section
  id="hero-section"
  class="relative w-full min-h-[680px] md:min-h-[82vh] lg:min-h-[750px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#26231F]"
>
  <!-- Full-bleed background image -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full hero-bg-container z-0">
    <img
      src="/images/hero-facial.jpg"
      alt="Tratamento facial na Élan Estética"
      class="hero-bg-img w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
      loading="eager"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- Soft luxury gradient overlay for pristine contrast while keeping photo vivid -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/45 via-black/15 to-black/30 z-10"></div>

  <!-- Hero Content Center Stage -->
  <div class="relative z-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center px-6 sm:px-10 py-20">
    <span class="hero-fade inline-block text-[11px] md:text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[3px] uppercase text-white/90 mb-5 bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-md px-5 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/20">
      Estética Integrada & Bem-Estar
    </span>

    <!-- SplitText Target Title -->
    <h1 class="hero-split-title split-reveal font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-light text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.2] pb-3 mb-6">
      Seu tempo de cuidar começa agora.
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-fade font-sans text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-white/90 max-w-xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed mb-8">
      Protocolos pensados para valorizar a sua beleza natural com leveza, delicadeza e precisão científica.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-fade flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/5511999999999?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Gostaria%20de%20agendar%20uma%20consulta%20na%20%C3%89lan%20Est%C3%A9tica."
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full sm:w-auto h-12 px-9 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-elan-green hover:bg-elan-dark text-white rounded-full border border-white/15 shadow-xl transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer"
      >
        Agendar consulta
      </a>
      <a
        href="#tratamentos"
        class="text-xs font-sans font-semibold tracking-wider text-white hover:text-elan-nude transition-colors uppercase py-2.5 px-5"
      >
        Conhecer rituais &darr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
